==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Lost Origin|Ambipom|145}} from the {{TCG|Lost Origin}} expansion.
*'''Tail Jab''' is a move that first appeared in {{TCG ID|Steam Siege|Aipom|90}} from the {{TCG|Steam Siege}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Moon}}.

